==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|stórr|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|stōraz|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/stouːr/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ouːr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|stærri|stærstur}}

# [[big]]
# [[great]]

====Inflection====
{{is-decl-adj-2|st|ó|r}}

====Usage notes====
Refers to [[stature]] and [[size]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|stikla á stóru}}

